    "result": "I rewrote `Slug` in `slug.go` to follow all the rules, but it is not tested yet. `go test` needs your approval, and this session could not get it.\n\n- **Letters:** a Go `strings.Replacer` turns the accented letters into plain ASCII. It runs after lower-casing, so capitals are covered too.\n- **Dashes:** one pass over the text turns each run of other characters into a single dash, with none at the start or end.\n- **Length:** a slug over 40 characters is cut at the last dash within the first 41 characters. If no dash is there, it is cut to the first 40 characters.\n- **Empty:** an empty result gives `untitled`.\n\nI added `TestSlugCases` to `slug_test.go`. It covers accents, capitals, empty input, symbol-only input, and each length boundary. The existing test is unchanged.\n\nRun `go test ./...` to check it.",
